    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Drake Warren is an industrial engineer. His campaign says he has a decade of experience organizing around healthcare access, environmental restoration and housing. His campaign says he would maintain the county-run healthcare system and provide alternative coverage for more than 30,000 patients projected to lose CountyCare under federal cuts. His campaign proposes raising vacant land assessments, consolidating taxing bodies, offering pre-approved building plans for vacant county land, and creating a revolving loan fund for affordable housing. He supports expanding the Access Pilot Program to provide reduced-fare transit on CTA and Pace. He has proposed barring officials from votes tied to their employers and making the commissioner position full-time.",
